\begin_layout Standard
These formulas were first derived for the conventional interval 
\begin_inset Formula $[0,h]$
\end_inset
 with 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 expanded about the midpoint. The Legendre moments over 
\begin_inset Formula $[0,h]$
\end_inset
, with 
\begin_inset Formula $P_k(2\tau/h-1)$
\end_inset
, are the centered moments of Eq. 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:gdef"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
 with 
\begin_inset Formula $h=2t$
\end_inset
, and the two series agree term by term (as verified in 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "j28"
literal "false"
\end_inset
 through weight 9), so the formulas carry over to the centered interval unchanged. All results below were re-verified against the centered series.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Section*
Number of commutators
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
As in 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "j28"
literal "false"
\end_inset
, each formula is a sequence of nested commutators 
\begin_inset Formula $C_i=[X_i,Y_i]$
\end_inset
, where 
\begin_inset Formula $X_i$
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $Y_i$
\end_inset
 are linear combinations of the moments and earlier commutators and each has definite parity, followed by 
\begin_inset Formula $\Omega=g_0+\sum_i c_i\cdot C_i$
\end_inset
. The orders 4, 6 and 8 require 1, 3 and 6 commutators, the minimum numbers stated by Blanes, Casas and Ros 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "bcr2002"
literal "false"
\end_inset
; no order-10 formula has been published, as far as we know. The search at order 10 computed, for each pattern of operand parities, the maximum generic rank of the Jacobian of the 70 order conditions with respect to the free coefficients, and then searched for exact solutions with Levenberg-Marquardt iterations from random starting points (Table 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:search"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
):
\end_layout

