\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The accompanying function magnus10coef.m, called as [x,y] = magnus10coef(), returns the coefficients 
\begin_inset Formula $x_1,\ldots,x_{81}$
\end_inset
 of Eq. 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:f10"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $y_1,\ldots,y_{96}$
\end_inset
 of Eqs. 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:stage2"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "eq:stage2b"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
\end_inset
 as column vectors, in the order of Appendices A and B. Rational coefficients are written as exact fractions and irrational ones to 30 significant digits.
\end_layout

